            "plainText": "See Table 28-112.7.3 .\n\n Table 28-112.7.3 \n\n   Inspection Type \n Filing Fee \n Renewal Fee \n Comments \n\n Each inspection of a temporary amusement device\n $130\n\n Marquee inspection.\n $15 annually for each one hundred square feet or fraction thereof.\n\n Place of assembly inspection, including following a violation.\n $130 each inspection, each place of assembly.\n\n Search inspection of a building with a frontage of 25 feet or less and a depth of one hundred feet or less.\n $20 for each floor for the first three floors;\n $10 for each additional floor;\n $130 minimum total.\n\n A basement or a cellar shall count as a floor. Where both a basement and a cellar exist, the cellar shall not count as a floor in computing fee.\n\n ∙    Additional fee for building with frontage exceeding 25 feet.\n\n Increase above fee by 40% for each floor for each additional 25 feet or fraction thereof.\n\n ∙    Additional fee for building with depth exceeding 100 feet.\n\n Increase above fee by 25% for each floor for each additional 25 feet or fraction thereof.\n\n (Am. L.L. 2021/126, 11/7/2021, eff. 11/7/2022) \n\n Editor's note: For related unconsolidated provisions, see Appendix A at L.L. 2021/126 ."
        }
